### ============================================================
### ACTIVITES
### ============================================================

### Activité récurrente - assemblée générale mensuelle col-1
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
x-api-key: agri-secure-key
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Assemblée générale mensuelle",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 2,
      "dayOfWeek": "SU"
    }
  }
]

###

### Activité à date fixe - formation col-1
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
x-api-key: agri-secure-key
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Formation technique riziculture",
    "activityType": "TRAINING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "executiveDate": "2026-06-15"
  }
]

###

### 400 - recurrenceRule ET executiveDate simultanés
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
x-api-key: agri-secure-key
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Activité invalide",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 2,
      "dayOfWeek": "SU"
    },
    "executiveDate": "2026-06-15"
