### ============================================================
### ATTENDANCE
### Remplace {activityId} par le vrai id retourné ci-dessus
### ============================================================

### POST attendance - marquer présences
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities/{activityId}/attendance
x-api-key: agri-secure-key
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "memberIdentifier": "C1-M1",
    "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"
  },
  {
    "memberIdentifier": "C1-M2",
    "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"
  },
  {
    "memberIdentifier": "C1-M3",
    "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"
  },
  {
    "memberIdentifier": "C1-M4",
    "attendanceStatus": "MISSING"
  },
  {
    "memberIdentifier": "C1-M5",
    "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"
  },
  {
    "memberIdentifier": "C1-M6",
    "attendanceStatus": "MISSING"
  },
  {
    "memberIdentifier": "C1-M7",
    "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"
  },
  {
    "memberIdentifier": "C1-M8",
    "attendanceStatus": "MISSING"
  }
]

